  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve noted: $450 on groceries and $120 on gas (total $570). I can remember this for the rest of our conversation.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following now?\n- Save these as a draft email (to yourself) summarizing this week’s expenses\n- Send this summary to someone (please provide their email)\n- Add more expenses now\n- Just keep this in mind for the conversation\n\nTell me which and any details (recipient email, subject line, or extra items) and I’ll take care of it.",
      "duration_s": 13.157,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve noted these for our conversation.\n\nSummary I’ve recorded:\n- Expenses: $450 groceries, $120 gas — total $570.\n- Sales activity: 3 sales calls, closed 2 deals ($5,000 and $3,500) — total revenue $8,500, and 4 follow-up meetings scheduled.\n- Net (revenue − expenses): $8,500 − $570 = $7,930.\n\nWhat would you like me to do with this? Options:\n- Draft or send an email summarizing this (to yourself or someone else)\n- Save this as a draft note\n- Add the 4 follow-up meetings to your calendar (I’ll need dates/times)\n- Log the deals to a CRM or prepare a report/email to your manager\n- Keep this in mind only for the conversation\n\nTell me which action (and any details like recipient email, subject, or meeting times) and I’ll take care of it.",
      "duration_s": 21.746,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve recorded your study sessions: Monday 3.0 hrs, Tuesday 4.0 hrs, Wednesday 2.5 hrs (total 9.5 hours).\n\nUpdated summary I’ve noted:\n- Expenses: $450 groceries, $120 gas (total $570)\n- Sales: 3 calls, 2 closed deals ($5,000 and $3,500) — revenue $8,500; 4 follow-up meetings scheduled\n- Study time for exam: 9.5 hours (Mon/Tue/Wed)\n\nWhat would you like me to do with this? Options:\n- Save or send an email summarizing these items (to whom? subject?)\n- Add study sessions to your calendar or set reminders (I’ll need dates/times)\n- Save as a draft note\n- Keep this only in our conversation memory\n\nTell me which action and any details, and I’ll take care of it.",
      "duration_s": 22.114,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "user_message": "Save this to memory: I drank 6 glasses of water today, which is 48 ounces total.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I drank 6 glasses of water today, which is 48 ounces total",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved that: you drank 6 glasses of water today (48 oz).\n\nUpdated items I’m remembering now include that water entry along with your expenses, sales activity, study sessions, and meetings. Would you like me to:\n- Add this to a health log or calendar reminder,\n- Draft/send an email summarizing these items, or\n- Just keep it stored for our conversation?",
      "duration_s": 16.594,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "user_message": "Keep in mind that I worked 8.5 hours on Monday, 7 hours on Tuesday, and 9 hours on Wednesday this week.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I worked 8.5 hours on Monday, 7 hours on Tuesday, and 9 hours on Wednesday this week",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved that: you worked 8.5 hours on Monday, 7 hours on Tuesday, and 9 hours on Wednesday (24.5 hours total).\n\nUpdated items I’m remembering now (high-level):\n- Work hours this week: Mon 8.5, Tue 7, Wed 9 (24.5 hrs)\n- Study time for exam: Mon 3, Tue 4, Wed 2.5 (9.5 hrs)\n- Sales: 3 calls today; closed deals $5,000 and $3,500 (revenue $8,500); 4 follow-up meetings scheduled\n- Expenses: $450 groceries, $120 gas (total $570)\n- Health: drank 6 glasses of water today (48 oz)\n\nWhat would you like me to do with this? I can:\n- Add the work hours to a timesheet or calendar (need dates/times/paycode)\n- Draft/send an email summarizing these items\n- Save as a formal note/draft\n- Just keep this stored for our conversation\n\nTell me which action (and any details) and I’ll take care of it.",
      "duration_s": 20.101,
      "success_check": null
